            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Travel Cafe",
            "review_text": "Do Dinh T\nToyama, Japan1 contribution\n0\nA cozy hotel and nice staff\nJan 2015 • Business\nStayed in this hotel for 4 nights. This is a fantastic hotel, staff are incredibly friendly and helpful, bear in mind english is not their first language but feel free to ask questions and chat to them as they will help make your stay special. The rooms are great value for the amount charged, Location is amazing, right in the old quarter and close to some bars and restaurants. Hanoi itself is a great place but easy to be taken advantage of if an inexperienced traveller. If thats you, ask the hotel staff for advise and follow their recommendations\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 14, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
