            "review_text": "26lahu\n23 contributions\n0\nA little gem of a breakfast place in Hanoi's Old Quarter\nDelicious breakfasts are served here One selection consists of fresh fruit slices, 3 eggs, a bit of sliced bacon, 2 sausages, tiny pancakes, toast with butter and jam, plus a banana shake. Coffee is hot and good. Staff is pleasant. Open 6 am. Free Internet. Small seating area holds maybe 15 total. Cozy and pleasant. They can book travel as well.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 10, 2011",
